QUOTED PROMPTS ARE NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE.

Prompts collected here remain the copyright of their respective authors.
They are quoted with attribution and a link to the original source, for
reference and study — the same basis on which "awesome list" collections
operate. Every entry keeps its author and source URL.

Official documentation (Remotion and others) is linked, never copied.

If you are the author of a prompt in this repository and want it amended,
better credited, or removed, open an issue. It will be actioned promptly
and without argument.
